blurb: The school board voted to send two distinct, conflicting questions regarding
  the South Portland High School athletic complex improvements to a November 2025
  referendum, one for natural grass and one for synthetic turf, allowing voters to
  decide. The board also addressed procedural concerns about ballot wording and heard
  public input on budget priorities.
